PLACEHOLDER: Quinn Logo

This file should be a 40x40px PNG image of the Quinn/Studio Voly logo.

The logo is loaded dynamically by the StartupWidget.UI.psm1 module.
If this file doesn't exist, the widget will still function but without the icon.

Options:
1. Add quinn-logo.png (40x40px PNG) to this directory
2. Reference the existing StudioVolySplash.png from ../StudioVolySplash.png
3. Create a simple icon and place it here

Current image control will try to load: quinn-logo.png
If you want to use a different image, update the path in StartupWidget.UI.psm1:
  Line ~20: $pngPath = Join-Path $PSScriptRoot "quinn-logo.png"
